@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5000
@depositKey = 8b9e95ed-03a3-412c-936b-8ca9d09438d2
@withdrawalKey = 7cd82c2b-7523-4160-9151-5629db2a097d
@transferKey = 7b28107e-36fd-4143-b89c-8d043b441e9f
# Run the successful operations in order. Change keys for new submissions, keep them for retries.

### Accounts: 200, two accounts sorted by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts

### Deposit $25.00 into Checking: 201 (initial balance becomes 2500)
# @name deposit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{depositKey}}

{"type":"deposit","destinationAccountId":1,"amountMinor":2500}

### Original receipt: 200 (run the named deposit request first)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{deposit.response.headers.Location}}

### Exact replay: 201, identical receipt and Location, no extra deposit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{depositKey}}

{"type":"deposit","sourceAccountId":null,"destinationAccountId":1,"amountMinor":2500}

### Changed payload with same key: 409 idempotency_conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{depositKey}}

{"type":"deposit","destinationAccountId":1,"amountMinor":2501}

### Withdraw $5.00: 201 (Checking becomes 2000 on a fresh database)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{withdrawalKey}}

{"type":"withdrawal","sourceAccountId":1,"amountMinor":500}

### Transfer $10.00 from Checking to Savings: 201 (1000 in each account)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{transferKey}}

{"type":"transfer","sourceAccountId":1,"destinationAccountId":2,"amountMinor":1000}

### Checking history: 200, all three operations; newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/1/transactions?page=1&pageSize=2

### Next page: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/1/transactions?page=2&pageSize=2

### Savings history: 200, the same transfer receipt
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/2/transactions

### Invalid amount: 400 validation_error with errors.amountMinor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"type":"deposit","destinationAccountId":1,"amountMinor":0}

### Fractional cents: 400 validation_error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"type":"deposit","destinationAccountId":1,"amountMinor":1.5}

### Same-account transfer: 400 validation_error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"type":"transfer","sourceAccountId":1,"destinationAccountId":1,"amountMinor":100}

### Unknown property: 400 validation_error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"type":"deposit","destinationAccountId":1,"amountMinor":100,"unexpected":true}

### Malformed JSON: 400 validation_error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"type":

### Missing key: 400 validation_error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"deposit","destinationAccountId":1,"amountMinor":100}

### Invalid key: 400 validation_error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: not-a-uuid

{"type":"deposit","destinationAccountId":1,"amountMinor":100}

### Invalid pagination: 400 validation_error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/1/transactions?pageSize=101

### Malformed transaction ID: 400 validation_error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/not-a-uuid

### Missing account: 404 account_not_found
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"type":"deposit","destinationAccountId":3,"amountMinor":100}

### History for a missing account: 404 account_not_found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/3/transactions

### Missing transaction: 404 transaction_not_found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/eea9c909-6504-48e2-922c-9b64abae7214

### Insufficient funds: 409 insufficient_funds after the sample sequence
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"type":"withdrawal","sourceAccountId":1,"amountMinor":1000000000}

### Balance limit: 409 balance_limit_exceeded after the sample sequence
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"type":"deposit","destinationAccountId":1,"amountMinor":1000000000}

### Non-JSON content: 415 unsupported_media_type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: text/plain
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{"type":"deposit","destinationAccountId":1,"amountMinor":100}

# Database failures (500/503), forced rollback, concurrency, and restart are exercised
# by the integration suite. There are intentionally no failure-injection endpoints.
